              <div class="subsection">
                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>Destroys the current <a href="Playables.Playable.html">Playable</a>.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="subsection">
        <p>NOTE: Any other Playables connected to the destroyed Playable's output ports will be orphaned; they will still exist in the <a href="Playables.PlayableGraph.html">PlayableGraph</a>, but will not be updated until they are connected to a graph branch that is connected to a <a href="Playables.PlayableOutput.html">PlayableOutput</a>.</p>
      </div>
              <div class="subsection">
        <p>Use this templated extension method on any type that inherits from <a href="Playables.IPlayable.html">IPlayable</a>.</p>
