              <div class="subsection">
                <h3>Description</h3>
                <p>Indicates a composite operation that composes geometry using a Boolean AND operation.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="subsection">
        <p>This composite operation will result in a region where both regions of geometry overlap.<br /><br />Additional resources: <a href="Collider2D-compositeOperation.html">Collider2D.compositeOperation</a> and <a href="Collider2D-compositeOrder.html">Collider2D.compositeOrder</a>.</p>
