                <p>Dollar sign key '$'. Deprecated if "Use Physical Keys" is enabled in <a href="../Manual/class-InputManager.html">Input Manager settings</a>, use <a href="KeyCode.Alpha4.html">KeyCode.Alpha4</a> instead.</p>
